name issue_12_lossbwe_random_loss
describe 5% random loss on a 2 Mbps link with 40 ms one-way delay: the loss-based estimate must not pin the target (#6, #12)
# LossBasedBweV2 (cc v2) tells inherent loss (noise at any rate) from loss caused by the sending rate.
# 5 seeds (cc v2): utilization 75.7-82.1 %, video 1311-1420 kbps, no freezes. `cc v1`: 35-53 %. libwebrtc (CI compare-webrtc, random_loss_5pct): 76 %, 1355 kbps.
duration 30s
at 0s capacity=2000kbps delay=40ms jitter=3ms loss=5% queue=300ms
expect cc.utilization_pct >= 70
# Was < 200. Lip sync on by default (#77 step 3, PR #306; program.md 0.2, needs Owner sign-off): ours 226 on seed 1; libwebrtc with sync_group 415.2 (mean of 10 seeds), worst seed 1028.
expect video.freeze_total_ms < 270
expect audio.concealed_pct < 3
expect audio.interruptions == 0
